```css
.btn { font: 700 13px/1 'NC Sans',sans-serif; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; clip-path: polygon(0 0,100% 0,calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%); transition: background var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out); }
